  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 653 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the ketorolac tromethamine injection shortage on 2018-03-23 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E46", "D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Multiple manufacturers are listed on the FDA shortage list including Alembic Pharmaceuticals, Baxter Healthcare, Fresenius Kabi USA, Gland Pharma Limited, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA, Hospira Inc., and Sagent Pharmaceuticals.",
      "cites": ["E38", "E39", "E40", "E41", "E42", "E43", "E44"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) is a registered plant on the product label for NDC 00409379601.",
      "cites": ["E31"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 976095 at this plant ended 2016-06-08 and was classified OAI, 653 days before the shortage posting on 2018-03-23.",
      "cites": ["D9", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to this plant on 2017-02-14, 402 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E30"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1064827 at the same plant ended 2018-08-15 and was classified OAI, 145 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D14", "E27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Advanced Rx of Tennessee, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D20"]
    }
  ]
}
